Subject: [PATCH 03682/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE B2
 (RESERVED INFRA; adversarial_verify hardening -- the
 GOAL-ENERGY-WITHOUT-ABLATION guard) -- add a reader-side guard: an ARC
 artifact claiming an ENERGY-DRIVEN-GENERATION win (graded goal-energy /
 energy heuristic / energy-as-fitness raised live solve-rate/first-win) MUST
 report a UNIFORM-ENERGY ABLATION control that did NOT achieve it -- a win
 backed only by "energy-on beat the baseline" with no uniform/random-energy
 ablation WARN-fires (it might be the SEARCH, not the energy). Be NARROW: an
 artifact that HONESTLY reports the ablation (energy beats uniform) does NOT
 fire; an artifact reporting an energy magnitude as a diagnostic (no win
 claim) does NOT fire. Reader/guard only; edits adversarial_verify.py, never
 the conductor. Asserting tests.

Co-Authored-By: Codex CLI <noreply@openai.com>
